# TypeScript Code Quality Standards

- **Linter + Formatter**: Biome v2 (strict rules)
- **Type checker**: tsc strict mode (noUncheckedIndexedAccess, exactOptionalPropertyTypes)
- **Tests**: Vitest + @vitest/coverage-v8 (90%+ coverage)
- **Dead exports**: Knip
- **Typos**: codespell
